269
00:59:08.586 --> 00:59:09.586
Who you are.

270
00:59:10.586 --> 00:59:11.586
How you should approach things.

271
00:59:12.586 --> 00:59:13.586
How you handle relationships.

272
00:59:14.586 --> 00:59:15.586
How you speak.

273
00:59:16.586 --> 00:59:18.586
