280
00:59:40.586 --> 00:59:42.586
And they guide you back up.

281
00:59:42.586 --> 00:59:44.586
At least, that's handy.

282
00:59:45.586 --> 00:59:47.586
And then you are in a new creation.

283
00:59:48.586 --> 00:59:50.586
Only, this sometimes needs to sink in.

