290
01:00:12.586 --> 01:00:13.586
and here He has truly risen...

291
01:00:14.586 --> 01:00:15.586
and everyone happy fireworks...

292
01:00:16.586 --> 01:00:17.586
and then we have a baptism service.

293
01:00:18.586 --> 01:00:19.586
