309
01:00:58.586 --> 01:00:59.586
So the church has existed longer than you.

310
01:01:00.586 --> 01:01:01.586
Glory, hallelujah.

311
01:01:02.586 --> 01:01:03.586
And I think it's wonderful.

312
01:01:03.586 --> 01:01:05.586
And I tell you, and I say it more often...

313
01:01:06.586 --> 01:01:07.586
and I keep repeating it...

314
01:01:08.586 --> 01:01:10.586
