315
01:01:11.586 --> 01:01:12.586
I tell you, this church...

316
01:01:13.586 --> 01:01:16.586
this church will continue to exist until Jesus returns.

317
01:01:17.586 --> 01:01:18.586
I mean it seriously.

318
01:01:19.586 --> 01:01:20.586
This church...

319
01:01:21.586 --> 01:01:22.586
I mean it.

320
01:01:23.586 --> 01:01:26.586
This church will stand face to face with the return of the Lord.

321
01:01:27.586 --> 01:01:29.586
And then we all put on open church T-shirts...

322
01:01:30.586 --> 01:01:31.586
and say, look Lord, here we stand.

323
01:01:31.586 --> 01:01:32.586
And the Lord says...

324
01:01:35.586 --> 01:01:37.586
But coming back to Easter.

325
01:01:38.586 --> 01:01:40.586
So last week it was Easter...

326
01:01:41.586 --> 01:01:43.586
and I gave a piece of teaching about baptism.

