01:01:44.586 --> 01:01:46.586
And this is important, because when you baptize people...

328
01:01:47.586 --> 01:01:48.586
you don't just want to perform the baptism...

329
01:01:49.586 --> 01:01:51.586
and have people baptized just because of the hype...

