01:01:52.586 --> 01:01:53.586
and not know what is happening.

331
01:01:54.586 --> 01:01:55.586
So you need to provide sufficient teaching about it.

332
01:01:56.586 --> 01:01:58.586
So I don't want to rush through Easter...

333
01:01:59.586 --> 01:02:01.586
and talk about baptism...

334
01:02:02.586 --> 01:02:03.586
and then...

335
01:02:04.586 --> 01:02:05.586
the majesty...

336
01:02:06.586 --> 01:02:08.586
